Dialogue: 4,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before you check again,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:03.42,0:00:05.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,pray through tonight’s worries
Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.50,0:00:08.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,and place each concern in God’s care.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:09.06,0:00:11.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may have checked the same
Dialogue: 4,0:00:11.18,0:00:12.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,message several times,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:12.78,0:00:14.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,hoping a reply would
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.25,0:00:15.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,change how you feel.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:15.89,0:00:18.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can put the phone within
Dialogue: 4,0:00:18.02,0:00:20.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,reach but turn its face away.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:20.40,0:00:22.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the place where you are sitting
Dialogue: 4,0:00:22.80,0:00:24.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,or lying support your weight.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:24.98,0:00:27.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can arrive with a busy mind.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:27.84,0:00:28.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,In this prayer,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:28.92,0:00:31.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,you will name your concerns separately,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:31.70,0:00:33.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,so you do not have to wrestle
Dialogue: 4,0:00:33.78,0:00:36.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,with every uncertainty at once.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:37.37,0:00:40.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Casting all your care upon him;
Dialogue: 4,0:00:40.14,0:00:42.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,for he careth for you.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:43.88,0:00:44.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:44.42,0:00:46.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,I begin with the concern
Dialogue: 4,0:00:46.27,0:00:48.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,closest to the surface.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:48.22,0:00:49.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,I give it a plain
Dialogue: 4,0:00:49.58,0:00:51.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,name before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:51.03,0:00:53.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,It may be an unanswered message,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:53.62,0:00:55.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,a decision at work,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:55.16,0:00:58.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,or someone whose voice sounded troubled.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:58.59,0:01:00.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have carried it through
Dialogue: 4,0:01:00.44,0:01:02.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,dinner and into this room.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:02.54,0:01:05.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now I bring it into our conversation.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:05.95,0:01:07.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me entrust this
Dialogue: 4,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,particular care to you,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:09.12,0:01:11.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,even before my feelings catch
Dialogue: 4,0:01:11.26,0:01:13.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,up with the words I am praying.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:14.92,0:01:17.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,When several worries arrive together,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:17.63,0:01:20.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can feel as though your whole
Dialogue: 4,0:01:20.04,0:01:22.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,life needs fixing before bedtime.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:22.63,0:01:25.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can take a smaller approach here.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:25.54,0:01:28.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are allowed to name one subject
Dialogue: 4,0:01:28.14,0:01:30.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let the others wait their turn.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:30.91,0:01:34.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need a complete explanation.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:34.05,0:01:35.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,A person’s name,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:35.37,0:01:36.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,a pending answer,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:36.77,0:01:39.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a sentence about tomorrow
Dialogue: 4,0:01:39.08,0:01:40.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,is enough to begin.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:40.82,0:01:43.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are addressing someone who cares
Dialogue: 4,0:01:43.34,0:01:46.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,about the person doing the praying.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:47.18,0:01:47.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:47.59,0:01:49.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the answer
Dialogue: 4,0:01:49.07,0:01:50.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot make arrive.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:50.98,0:01:52.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have imagined reasons
Dialogue: 4,0:01:52.72,0:01:54.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the silence and measured
Dialogue: 4,0:01:54.83,0:01:57.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,the hours since I last checked.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:57.35,0:01:59.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me stop treating a missing
Dialogue: 4,0:01:59.73,0:02:02.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,reply as a verdict about my worth.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:02.52,0:02:04.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,If there is a sensible
Dialogue: 4,0:02:04.23,0:02:05.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,time to follow up,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:05.64,0:02:08.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,let me choose it in daylight.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:08.08,0:02:09.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,For this evening,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:09.39,0:02:10.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,receive both my hope
Dialogue: 4,0:02:10.94,0:02:12.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my disappointment.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:12.82,0:02:15.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hold the uncertainty I cannot
Dialogue: 4,0:02:15.08,0:02:17.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,settle by checking again.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:18.40,0:02:18.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:18.94,0:02:21.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me make one kind boundary
Dialogue: 4,0:02:21.24,0:02:23.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,with the stream of information.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:23.79,0:02:26.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let necessary messages remain
Dialogue: 4,0:02:26.35,0:02:28.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,available without making every
Dialogue: 4,0:02:28.99,0:02:31.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,notification my responsibility.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:31.90,0:02:34.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for wisdom about the difference
Dialogue: 4,0:02:34.81,0:02:36.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,between being reachable
Dialogue: 4,0:02:36.61,0:02:39.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,and being constantly on watch.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:39.15,0:02:42.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,If no urgent duty requires my attention,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:42.49,0:02:45.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me let the phone grow quiet.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:45.43,0:02:46.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,I give you the impulse
Dialogue: 4,0:02:46.92,0:02:48.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,to search for one more update,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:48.96,0:02:50.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the fear that stopping
Dialogue: 4,0:02:50.73,0:02:52.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,means I have stopped caring.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:54.02,0:02:56.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be careful for nothing;
Dialogue: 5,0:02:56.16,0:02:58.18,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}but in every thing by prayer
Dialogue: 5,0:02:58.18,0:03:00.93,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and supplication with thanksgiving let
Dialogue: 5,0:03:00.93,0:03:03.96,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}your requests be made known unto God.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:05.29,0:03:07.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,You hear an invitation
Dialogue: 4,0:03:07.16,0:03:09.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,to bring requests to God.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:09.48,0:03:11.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can speak about what you need
Dialogue: 4,0:03:11.83,0:03:13.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,without first making yourself
Dialogue: 4,0:03:13.90,0:03:15.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,sound confident.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:15.22,0:03:18.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can ask for an honest conversation,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:18.23,0:03:19.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,a workable plan,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:19.46,0:03:22.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,or help getting through an appointment.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:22.64,0:03:25.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your request can be specific.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:25.12,0:03:26.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can also remember
Dialogue: 4,0:03:26.82,0:03:29.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,a small kindness from today.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:29.27,0:03:31.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,Gratitude gives another
Dialogue: 4,0:03:31.09,0:03:33.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,truth room beside the worry;
Dialogue: 4,0:03:33.48,0:03:35.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,you do not have to pretend
Dialogue: 4,0:03:35.36,0:03:38.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,the worry has already disappeared.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:39.19,0:03:39.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:39.57,0:03:41.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name the work concern
Dialogue: 4,0:03:41.30,0:03:43.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,that followed me home.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:43.13,0:03:45.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,There is something I sent,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:45.19,0:03:46.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,something I missed,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:46.70,0:03:48.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,or something I may
Dialogue: 4,0:03:48.13,0:03:49.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,be asked to explain.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:49.90,0:03:51.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me separate the actual
Dialogue: 4,0:03:51.90,0:03:53.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,facts from the harsh story
Dialogue: 4,0:03:53.83,0:03:55.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am telling about myself.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:55.94,0:03:57.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,If I made an error,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:57.32,0:03:59.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me the honesty to acknowledge
Dialogue: 4,0:03:59.78,0:04:02.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,it and the patience to correct it.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:02.42,0:04:05.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight I hand over the imagined
Dialogue: 4,0:04:05.03,0:04:07.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,meeting that keeps starting
Dialogue: 4,0:04:07.23,0:04:09.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,again inside my head.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:10.33,0:04:10.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:10.86,0:04:12.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,make the next useful step
Dialogue: 4,0:04:12.75,0:04:14.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,clear enough to recognize.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:14.90,0:04:17.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I need to check a number,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:17.51,0:04:18.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,ask a question,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:18.69,0:04:20.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,or explain a delay.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:20.37,0:04:22.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,I do not need to rehearse every
Dialogue: 4,0:04:22.96,0:04:26.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,response another person might give.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:26.06,0:04:28.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me prepare what is mine
Dialogue: 4,0:04:28.20,0:04:30.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,to prepare and leave their
Dialogue: 4,0:04:30.20,0:04:32.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,reaction outside my control.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:32.53,0:04:35.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive my desire to do good work.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:35.80,0:04:37.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let that desire become
Dialogue: 4,0:04:37.43,0:04:39.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,steady attention tomorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:39.35,0:04:41.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,rather than another hour
Dialogue: 4,0:04:41.12,0:04:43.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,of self-punishment tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:44.50,0:04:44.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:44.81,0:04:47.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,I remember a moment today when someone
Dialogue: 4,0:04:47.80,0:04:50.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,made a difficult thing easier.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:50.33,0:04:52.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Perhaps they answered patiently,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:52.87,0:04:53.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,held a door,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:53.82,0:04:56.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,or let me start a sentence again.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:56.62,0:05:00.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thank you for that ordinary generosity.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:00.06,0:05:01.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the ability
Dialogue: 4,0:05:01.83,0:05:03.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,to ask for help and for people
Dialogue: 4,0:05:03.96,0:05:05.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,who have helped before.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:05.76,0:05:08.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring this memory alongside
Dialogue: 4,0:05:08.12,0:05:09.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,the unfinished work.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:09.93,0:05:11.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,My day contained more than
Dialogue: 4,0:05:11.90,0:05:14.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,the moment I keep regretting;
Dialogue: 4,0:05:14.27,0:05:15.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me remember it
Dialogue: 4,0:05:15.76,0:05:17.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,with greater honesty.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:18.79,0:05:20.37,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}And the peace of God,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:20.37,0:05:22.79,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}which passeth all understanding,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:22.79,0:05:24.45,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}shall keep your hearts
Dialogue: 5,0:05:24.45,0:05:27.14,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and minds through Christ Jesus.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:28.47,0:05:30.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have to solve
Dialogue: 4,0:05:30.16,0:05:32.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,the meaning of every word tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:32.72,0:05:34.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Notice that the promise
Dialogue: 4,0:05:34.44,0:05:36.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,speaks of hearts and minds,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:36.45,0:05:38.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,the very places where
Dialogue: 4,0:05:38.01,0:05:39.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,you may feel tired.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:39.60,0:05:42.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can ask for God’s peace while
Dialogue: 4,0:05:42.05,0:05:43.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,there are unanswered
Dialogue: 4,0:05:43.53,0:05:45.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,questions around you.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:45.26,0:05:46.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are not being asked
Dialogue: 4,0:05:46.95,0:05:49.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,to explain everything into order.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:49.54,0:05:51.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can turn toward Christ
Dialogue: 4,0:05:51.34,0:05:53.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,with the thoughts you have,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:53.21,0:05:55.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,including the ones you wish
Dialogue: 4,0:05:55.08,0:05:56.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,would leave you alone.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:57.98,0:05:58.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:58.52,0:06:00.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name the household expense
Dialogue: 4,0:06:00.69,0:06:03.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,that has been pressing on me.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:03.11,0:06:05.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the bill, the estimate,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:05.42,0:06:07.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,or the balance I need to review.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:07.98,0:06:09.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me clear judgment
Dialogue: 4,0:06:09.57,0:06:11.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,when I look at the facts.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:11.56,0:06:13.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me ask about arrangements
Dialogue: 4,0:06:13.71,0:06:14.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,when I need them,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:14.94,0:06:17.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,and speak honestly with anyone
Dialogue: 4,0:06:17.09,0:06:19.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,who shares this responsibility.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:19.50,0:06:21.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place these practical concerns
Dialogue: 4,0:06:21.90,0:06:24.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,before you without inventing a certainty
Dialogue: 4,0:06:24.89,0:06:27.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,about how they will turn out.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:27.24,0:06:30.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide my next responsible choice.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:31.52,0:06:31.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:31.91,0:06:33.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,I release the midnight
Dialogue: 4,0:06:33.64,0:06:36.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,calculations that repeat without
Dialogue: 4,0:06:36.17,0:06:38.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,giving me new information.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:38.40,0:06:39.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:39.13,0:06:41.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me set aside a definite
Dialogue: 4,0:06:41.41,0:06:43.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,time to look carefully,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:43.28,0:06:45.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,with paper, accurate figures,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:45.64,0:06:48.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,and whatever advice is needed.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:48.26,0:06:51.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep shame from isolating me.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:51.08,0:06:53.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let courage take the form
Dialogue: 4,0:06:53.04,0:06:54.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,of a call made
Dialogue: 4,0:06:54.13,0:06:55.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a question asked.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:55.87,0:06:58.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight I give you my fear
Dialogue: 4,0:06:58.09,0:06:59.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,of falling behind,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:59.63,0:07:02.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,and ask for companionship and wisdom
Dialogue: 4,0:07:02.70,0:07:05.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,as I address what is real.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:06.30,0:07:07.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can pause before
Dialogue: 4,0:07:07.85,0:07:09.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,naming anything else.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:09.66,0:07:11.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Feel where your hands
Dialogue: 4,0:07:11.12,0:07:12.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,have come to rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:12.55,0:07:14.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need to move them
Dialogue: 4,0:07:14.60,0:07:16.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,into a special position.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:16.54,0:07:19.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let an ordinary breath come and go.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:19.48,0:07:20.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,For these moments,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:20.87,0:07:23.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can leave the unfinished
Dialogue: 4,0:07:23.05,0:07:25.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,calculation unfinished.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:28.01,0:07:29.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Take therefore no
Dialogue: 4,0:07:29.25,0:07:31.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,thought for the morrow:
Dialogue: 5,0:07:31.12,0:07:33.17,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for the morrow shall take thought
Dialogue: 5,0:07:33.17,0:07:34.90,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for the things of itself.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:34.90,0:07:36.85,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Sufficient unto the day
Dialogue: 5,0:07:36.85,0:07:38.90,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}is the evil thereof.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:40.23,0:07:42.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can prepare for tomorrow without
Dialogue: 4,0:07:42.77,0:07:45.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,trying to live it from your bed.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:45.21,0:07:46.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you already know
Dialogue: 4,0:07:46.84,0:07:48.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,the time of your appointment
Dialogue: 4,0:07:48.75,0:07:50.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,and where you put the keys.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:50.76,0:07:53.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have done something useful.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:53.20,0:07:54.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Beyond that,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:54.04,0:07:55.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,you may be rehearsing events
Dialogue: 4,0:07:55.98,0:07:57.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,that have not happened.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:57.76,0:08:00.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can notice the difference gently.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:00.60,0:08:02.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,This evening has its own limits,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:02.97,0:08:04.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you can let tomorrow’s
Dialogue: 4,0:08:04.90,0:08:07.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,conversation belong to tomorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:07.27,0:08:09.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,where you will have actual
Dialogue: 4,0:08:09.19,0:08:11.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,information to meet.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:12.06,0:08:12.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:12.57,0:08:15.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name the appointment on the calendar.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:15.60,0:08:17.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the questions
Dialogue: 4,0:08:17.29,0:08:19.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,I hope to ask and the answers
Dialogue: 4,0:08:19.61,0:08:21.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am afraid to hear.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:21.40,0:08:23.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me bring any notes
Dialogue: 4,0:08:23.15,0:08:24.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,or documents I need,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:24.67,0:08:26.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,and seek appropriate support
Dialogue: 4,0:08:26.80,0:08:28.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,if I want someone with me.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:28.96,0:08:32.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place the unknown parts before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:32.29,0:08:34.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me courage for the actual
Dialogue: 4,0:08:34.46,0:08:36.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,hour when it comes.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:36.02,0:08:38.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,I release the demand to experience
Dialogue: 4,0:08:38.83,0:08:42.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,that hour many times before it arrives.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:43.43,0:08:43.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:43.80,0:08:45.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name the person whose
Dialogue: 4,0:08:45.47,0:08:47.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,trouble weighs on me.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:47.18,0:08:49.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,I wish I could know exactly
Dialogue: 4,0:08:49.22,0:08:50.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,what they need and make
Dialogue: 4,0:08:50.95,0:08:52.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,their next day easier.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:52.80,0:08:54.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me listen to what they
Dialogue: 4,0:08:54.81,0:08:56.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,actually tell me.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:56.26,0:08:58.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep my concern from becoming
Dialogue: 4,0:08:58.62,0:09:01.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,pressure for them to reassure me.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:01.48,0:09:02.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Show me a practical
Dialogue: 4,0:09:02.97,0:09:05.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,kindness within my reach.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:05.11,0:09:07.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,As I leave the rest with you,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:07.34,0:09:08.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,teach me a love
Dialogue: 4,0:09:08.49,0:09:10.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,that respects their voice,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:10.48,0:09:11.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,their choices,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:11.56,0:09:13.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my own limits.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:14.32,0:09:16.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can care about someone
Dialogue: 4,0:09:16.31,0:09:18.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,deeply and still need a night
Dialogue: 4,0:09:18.52,0:09:20.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,away from problem solving.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:20.69,0:09:23.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may have already offered a ride,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:23.61,0:09:24.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,sent a message,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:24.82,0:09:27.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,or agreed on a time to speak.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:27.35,0:09:30.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can recognize that offering as real.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:30.71,0:09:32.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have to prove
Dialogue: 4,0:09:32.47,0:09:34.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,your love by staying mentally
Dialogue: 4,0:09:34.59,0:09:37.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,beside every possible difficulty.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:37.18,0:09:39.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where you have a genuine
Dialogue: 4,0:09:39.06,0:09:40.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,responsibility tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:40.86,0:09:42.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,attend to it.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:42.06,0:09:44.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where you have done your part,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:44.05,0:09:45.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,you may pause.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:46.36,0:09:46.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:46.91,0:09:48.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name the conversation
Dialogue: 4,0:09:48.73,0:09:50.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,that ended awkwardly.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:50.57,0:09:51.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,There was a look
Dialogue: 4,0:09:51.88,0:09:53.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,I could not read,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:53.27,0:09:55.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,a sentence I wish I had softened,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:55.97,0:09:58.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a silence I did not understand.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:58.92,0:10:00.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me resist filling
Dialogue: 4,0:10:00.62,0:10:02.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,that silence with accusations
Dialogue: 4,0:10:02.85,0:10:05.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,against myself or someone else.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:05.42,0:10:07.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I owe an apology,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:07.34,0:10:10.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,let it be sincere and specific.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:10.10,0:10:12.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I need clarification,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:12.39,0:10:14.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me ask kindly.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:14.18,0:10:16.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,I surrender the imaginary
Dialogue: 4,0:10:16.17,0:10:18.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,versions of that conversation
Dialogue: 4,0:10:18.48,0:10:20.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,that cannot give me truth.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:21.92,0:10:22.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:22.30,0:10:24.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,I accept responsibility
Dialogue: 4,0:10:24.03,0:10:26.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the words that were mine.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:26.39,0:10:29.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask your forgiveness where I used
Dialogue: 4,0:10:29.26,0:10:32.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,tiredness as an excuse to be unkind.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:32.39,0:10:35.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me make repair without demanding
Dialogue: 4,0:10:35.37,0:10:38.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,immediate reassurance in return.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:38.12,0:10:40.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,If another person needs time,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:40.28,0:10:42.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me patience with their pace.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:42.93,0:10:43.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:43.57,0:10:46.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,let remorse point toward an honest
Dialogue: 4,0:10:46.27,0:10:49.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,action instead of an endless replay.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:49.32,0:10:51.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place the relationship
Dialogue: 4,0:10:51.10,0:10:52.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,in your care while I wait
Dialogue: 4,0:10:52.95,0:10:55.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,for an appropriate moment to speak.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:56.93,0:10:59.82,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}In the multitude of my thoughts within
Dialogue: 5,0:10:59.82,0:11:02.61,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}me thy comforts delight my soul.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:03.94,0:11:05.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,The psalm gives you words
Dialogue: 4,0:11:05.73,0:11:07.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,for a crowded inner life.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:07.70,0:11:10.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can hear that multitude of thoughts
Dialogue: 4,0:11:10.61,0:11:12.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,named without embarrassment.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:12.88,0:11:15.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Perhaps your mind moves from
Dialogue: 4,0:11:15.14,0:11:17.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,a bill to a conversation
Dialogue: 4,0:11:17.08,0:11:19.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,to a forgotten errand in seconds.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:19.92,0:11:22.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have to chase every
Dialogue: 4,0:11:22.05,0:11:24.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,thought to its conclusion.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:24.07,0:11:25.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can receive one
Dialogue: 4,0:11:25.58,0:11:27.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,comfort at a time:
Dialogue: 4,0:11:27.20,0:11:28.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,a remembered kindness,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:28.88,0:11:30.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,a truthful verse,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:30.19,0:11:32.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,the knowledge that you can bring
Dialogue: 4,0:11:32.64,0:11:35.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,your confusion into prayer.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:36.09,0:11:36.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:36.40,0:11:39.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name the judgment I keep passing
Dialogue: 4,0:11:39.09,0:11:42.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,on myself when everything becomes quiet.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:42.43,0:11:43.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,I hear that I should
Dialogue: 4,0:11:43.85,0:11:44.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,have known more,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:44.99,0:11:45.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,finished more,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:45.98,0:11:48.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,or handled the day better.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:48.01,0:11:50.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me learn from what happened
Dialogue: 4,0:11:50.24,0:11:53.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,without treating myself with contempt.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:53.08,0:11:55.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Show me the difference between
Dialogue: 4,0:11:55.46,0:11:57.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,correction that helps me grow
Dialogue: 4,0:11:57.78,0:12:01.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,and accusation that only wears me down.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:01.06,0:12:02.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for the humility
Dialogue: 4,0:12:02.84,0:12:04.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,to be a learner,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:04.13,0:12:05.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,with room to receive
Dialogue: 4,0:12:05.74,0:12:07.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,mercy and try again.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:08.74,0:12:09.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:09.31,0:12:11.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring my tired body
Dialogue: 4,0:12:11.05,0:12:13.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,into this prayer as well.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:13.29,0:12:16.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,I notice the tension I carried through
Dialogue: 4,0:12:16.22,0:12:19.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,the day and the impatience I sometimes
Dialogue: 4,0:12:19.15,0:12:21.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,feel toward my own limits.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:21.34,0:12:23.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me respond with care.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:23.63,0:12:25.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide me toward appropriate
Dialogue: 4,0:12:25.77,0:12:27.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,help when I need it,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:27.35,0:12:28.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,and toward ordinary
Dialogue: 4,0:12:28.85,0:12:31.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,habits that support rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:31.00,0:12:32.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am not asking my body
Dialogue: 4,0:12:32.96,0:12:35.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,to prove my faith tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:35.34,0:12:37.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask to treat it as something
Dialogue: 4,0:12:37.58,0:12:40.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,entrusted to me with tenderness.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:41.35,0:12:43.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,A concern may come back after
Dialogue: 4,0:12:43.38,0:12:45.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,you have prayed about it.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:45.31,0:12:47.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can notice that without
Dialogue: 4,0:12:47.38,0:12:50.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,declaring the prayer unsuccessful.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:50.18,0:12:52.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are practicing trust with a mind
Dialogue: 4,0:12:52.62,0:12:55.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,that has learned to keep checking.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:55.10,0:12:57.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can simply recognize
Dialogue: 4,0:12:57.02,0:12:59.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,the familiar concern and bring
Dialogue: 4,0:12:59.42,0:13:02.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,it back to God in fewer words.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:02.00,0:13:04.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need to restart
Dialogue: 4,0:13:04.01,0:13:05.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,the whole evening.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:05.59,0:13:07.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can return as many
Dialogue: 4,0:13:07.36,0:13:08.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,times as you need,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:08.80,0:13:12.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,with less argument and more kindness.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:13.16,0:13:13.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:13.57,0:13:16.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,when the same concern returns,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:16.03,0:13:18.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me answer it gently.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:18.26,0:13:20.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have named it before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:20.66,0:13:22.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have considered whether
Dialogue: 4,0:13:22.60,0:13:25.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,anything requires action now.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:25.02,0:13:27.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,If there is no new information
Dialogue: 4,0:13:27.36,0:13:29.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,and no present responsibility,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:29.69,0:13:32.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me stop reopening the case.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:32.35,0:13:35.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive my repeated turning toward you.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:35.80,0:13:38.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me a patient trust that can
Dialogue: 4,0:13:38.43,0:13:40.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,be practiced in small moments,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:40.83,0:13:42.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,without demanding a perfect
Dialogue: 4,0:13:42.98,0:13:45.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,feeling or an uninterrupted
Dialogue: 4,0:13:45.14,0:13:47.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,silence inside my thoughts.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:48.68,0:13:51.52,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Thou wilt keep him in perfect peace,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:51.52,0:13:54.00,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}whose mind is stayed on thee:
Dialogue: 5,0:13:54.00,0:13:56.54,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}because he trusteth in thee.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:57.87,0:13:59.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can give your attention
Dialogue: 4,0:13:59.89,0:14:02.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,a place to return without forcing
Dialogue: 4,0:14:02.35,0:14:04.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,it to stay perfectly still.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:04.54,0:14:06.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,In Isaiah’s words,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:06.20,0:14:08.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,trust turns toward God.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:08.50,0:14:10.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can turn that way now.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:10.89,0:14:11.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,When you notice
Dialogue: 4,0:14:11.90,0:14:13.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,that you are planning again,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:13.79,0:14:15.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can come back to the prayer
Dialogue: 4,0:14:15.87,0:14:17.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,already underway.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:17.20,0:14:20.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are allowed to begin again quietly.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:20.24,0:14:22.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need to monitor
Dialogue: 4,0:14:22.05,0:14:24.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,your mind as though every wandering
Dialogue: 4,0:14:24.49,0:14:26.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,thought were evidence against
Dialogue: 4,0:14:26.52,0:14:28.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,the sincerity of your faith.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:29.85,0:14:30.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Faithful God,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:30.81,0:14:33.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place my trust in your character
Dialogue: 4,0:14:33.33,0:14:35.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,rather than the strength of
Dialogue: 4,0:14:35.33,0:14:36.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,my concentration.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:36.77,0:14:40.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,I know how easily my attention wanders.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:40.24,0:14:42.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me return to what is true
Dialogue: 4,0:14:42.25,0:14:44.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,about you with patience.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:44.04,0:14:46.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from using this prayer as
Dialogue: 4,0:14:46.59,0:14:49.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,another task to perform flawlessly.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:49.47,0:14:51.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,I want to become more
Dialogue: 4,0:14:51.07,0:14:52.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,honest in your presence,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:52.90,0:14:55.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,more willing to receive help,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:55.12,0:14:57.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,and more able to leave an unanswered
Dialogue: 4,0:14:57.86,0:15:00.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,question without following it
Dialogue: 4,0:15:00.08,0:15:02.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,through every imagined outcome.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:03.82,0:15:04.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:04.35,0:15:07.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have named the unanswered message,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:07.07,0:15:08.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,the work concern,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:08.36,0:15:10.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,the practical expense,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:10.02,0:15:11.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,the coming appointment,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:11.76,0:15:13.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the person I love.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:13.60,0:15:15.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive whichever of these
Dialogue: 4,0:15:15.60,0:15:17.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,belongs to my life tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:17.86,0:15:19.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive also the worry
Dialogue: 4,0:15:19.68,0:15:22.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,I could not explain aloud.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:22.02,0:15:24.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,I do not need to make them
Dialogue: 4,0:15:24.20,0:15:26.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,one enormous burden again.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:26.56,0:15:28.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,Each has been brought
Dialogue: 4,0:15:28.03,0:15:29.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,before you separately.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:29.74,0:15:31.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me remember that I can
Dialogue: 4,0:15:31.80,0:15:34.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,address one real responsibility
Dialogue: 4,0:15:34.17,0:15:36.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,at a time when morning comes.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:37.76,0:15:39.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may notice that a worry
Dialogue: 4,0:15:39.67,0:15:41.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,becomes less tangled when
Dialogue: 4,0:15:41.43,0:15:43.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,you give it a concrete task.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:43.59,0:15:45.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,You cannot schedule certainty,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:45.85,0:15:48.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,but you can schedule a question.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:48.44,0:15:49.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,You cannot determine
Dialogue: 4,0:15:49.98,0:15:51.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,a conversation’s outcome,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:51.90,0:15:53.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,but you can choose
Dialogue: 4,0:15:53.29,0:15:55.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,when to ask for one.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:55.00,0:15:57.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can make that distinction without
Dialogue: 4,0:15:57.65,0:16:00.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,dismissing what matters to you.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:00.05,0:16:02.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before the quieter readings begin,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:02.66,0:16:04.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,you will give one concern
Dialogue: 4,0:16:04.57,0:16:05.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,a practical place,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:05.95,0:16:07.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,so your mind does not have
Dialogue: 4,0:16:07.94,0:16:10.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,to serve as its reminder all night.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:12.01,0:16:13.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can be honest about
Dialogue: 4,0:16:13.77,0:16:15.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,what troubles me.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:15.37,0:16:17.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can ask for help before
Dialogue: 4,0:16:17.32,0:16:19.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,I reach the end of my strength.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:19.92,0:16:21.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can make a plan without
Dialogue: 4,0:16:21.97,0:16:24.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,predicting every result.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:24.11,0:16:26.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can care for another person without
Dialogue: 4,0:16:26.99,0:16:29.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,carrying their entire future.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:29.43,0:16:31.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can leave a message
Dialogue: 4,0:16:31.13,0:16:33.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,unanswered for a time when
Dialogue: 4,0:16:33.22,0:16:35.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,no urgent need is present.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:35.50,0:16:37.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,God receives the concern
Dialogue: 4,0:16:37.54,0:16:39.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can name and the concern
Dialogue: 4,0:16:39.75,0:16:42.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot yet put into words.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:43.52,0:16:45.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,Make this small commitment
Dialogue: 4,0:16:45.31,0:16:47.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,before the readings for sleep:
Dialogue: 4,0:16:47.56,0:16:49.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,choose one concern that needs
Dialogue: 4,0:16:49.78,0:16:51.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,attention tomorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:51.24,0:16:53.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,and give it one practical
Dialogue: 4,0:16:53.16,0:16:54.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,next step and a time.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:54.95,0:16:56.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,You might decide,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:56.31,0:16:57.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,“After breakfast,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:57.67,0:16:59.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will call about the bill.”
Dialogue: 4,0:16:59.91,0:17:01.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you need a reminder,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:01.75,0:17:04.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,write only that short line.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:04.09,0:17:06.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then close the note.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:06.04,0:17:08.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have given your responsibility
Dialogue: 4,0:17:08.38,0:17:09.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,a place in tomorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:09.76,0:17:11.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,so you can stop trying to keep
Dialogue: 4,0:17:11.82,0:17:14.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,it alive by rehearsing it tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:15.55,0:17:16.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:16.12,0:17:17.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,I commit this one step
Dialogue: 4,0:17:17.91,0:17:19.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,and its time to you.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:19.72,0:17:22.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me follow through with the strength
Dialogue: 4,0:17:22.60,0:17:25.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,and information available then.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:25.02,0:17:26.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,For tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:26.01,0:17:28.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will leave the note closed unless
Dialogue: 4,0:17:28.91,0:17:32.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,a genuine need changes the situation.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:32.15,0:17:33.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I want to reopen it
Dialogue: 4,0:17:33.93,0:17:35.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,merely to feel certain,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:35.64,0:17:37.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,remind me of the care
Dialogue: 4,0:17:37.20,0:17:38.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have already taken.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:38.94,0:17:41.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bless this modest act of trust,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:41.39,0:17:43.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,and guide me in the quieter
Dialogue: 4,0:17:43.52,0:17:45.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,hours that follow.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:46.32,0:17:48.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you want to affirm this
Dialogue: 4,0:17:48.28,0:17:50.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,prayer in the comments,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:50.01,0:17:51.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,write amen.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:51.02,0:17:52.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now let the Scripture
Dialogue: 4,0:17:52.54,0:17:55.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,readings accompany your rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:55.83,0:17:57.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can let your eyes settle
Dialogue: 4,0:17:57.80,0:18:00.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,wherever they are comfortable.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:00.08,0:18:00.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,From here,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:00.79,0:18:02.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,the pace stays gentle,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:02.33,0:18:04.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,with Scripture and short
Dialogue: 4,0:18:04.02,0:18:05.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,prayers for the night.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:05.74,0:18:07.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need to keep
Dialogue: 4,0:18:07.61,0:18:09.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,a list of the passages.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:09.66,0:18:12.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can receive one sentence and let
Dialogue: 4,0:18:12.37,0:18:14.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,the next arrive when it arrives.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:14.96,0:18:16.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,The concern you set down
Dialogue: 4,0:18:16.96,0:18:19.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,has a next step already.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:19.15,0:18:20.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may leave it there
Dialogue: 4,0:18:20.69,0:18:21.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,while you listen,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:21.87,0:18:23.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,without checking the time
Dialogue: 4,0:18:23.62,0:18:25.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,or measuring your progress.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:27.19,0:18:28.98,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}When thou liest down,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:28.98,0:18:31.29,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou shalt not be afraid:
Dialogue: 5,0:18:31.29,0:18:33.14,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}yea, thou shalt lie down,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:33.14,0:18:35.63,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and thy sleep shall be sweet.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:36.96,0:18:39.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,You hear a picture of lying
Dialogue: 4,0:18:39.09,0:18:41.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,down within the life of wisdom.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:41.71,0:18:44.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can let that picture be gentle
Dialogue: 4,0:18:44.18,0:18:46.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,company rather than another
Dialogue: 4,0:18:46.13,0:18:48.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,standard you must meet tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:48.56,0:18:50.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you are still alert,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:50.21,0:18:51.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can simply remain
Dialogue: 4,0:18:51.71,0:18:53.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,here with the reading.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:53.46,0:18:55.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have to manufacture
Dialogue: 4,0:18:55.95,0:18:58.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,a particular sensation.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:58.03,0:18:59.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your pillow can be a place
Dialogue: 4,0:18:59.94,0:19:01.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,to receive care,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:01.12,0:19:03.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,and this verse can be a prayerful
Dialogue: 4,0:19:03.55,0:19:06.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,hope you hold with open hands.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:07.44,0:19:07.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:07.85,0:19:10.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,I receive this ordinary place
Dialogue: 4,0:19:10.27,0:19:12.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,of rest with gratitude.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:12.37,0:19:13.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me stop treating
Dialogue: 4,0:19:13.91,0:19:15.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,the bedside as a desk where
Dialogue: 4,0:19:15.88,0:19:18.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,every problem must be solved.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:18.18,0:19:20.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the blanket be a blanket
Dialogue: 4,0:19:20.23,0:19:22.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the pillow a pillow.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:22.16,0:19:23.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for rest,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:23.38,0:19:25.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I leave the manner
Dialogue: 4,0:19:25.16,0:19:27.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,and timing outside my command.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:27.76,0:19:29.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me patience with this
Dialogue: 4,0:19:29.82,0:19:31.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,night as it unfolds.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:31.59,0:19:33.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,May I meet my own weariness
Dialogue: 4,0:19:33.70,0:19:35.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,with the kindness I would
Dialogue: 4,0:19:35.65,0:19:37.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,offer someone dear to me.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:39.29,0:19:41.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can allow the room
Dialogue: 4,0:19:41.00,0:19:42.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,to be ordinary.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:42.34,0:19:44.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,A distant sound, a little light,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:44.89,0:19:46.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a passing thought does
Dialogue: 4,0:19:46.88,0:19:49.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,not require you to begin again.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:49.52,0:19:52.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can stay with what is comfortable
Dialogue: 4,0:19:52.11,0:19:54.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let the reading continue.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:54.31,0:19:56.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need to create
Dialogue: 4,0:19:56.25,0:19:57.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,an ideal night before
Dialogue: 4,0:19:57.87,0:19:59.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,you are allowed to rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:59.91,0:20:00.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are here
Dialogue: 4,0:20:00.81,0:20:02.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the night you have,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:02.47,0:20:03.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you can meet it
Dialogue: 4,0:20:03.91,0:20:05.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,with less struggle,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:05.34,0:20:07.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,one quiet moment at a time.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:09.06,0:20:09.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,It is vain
Dialogue: 4,0:20:09.86,0:20:11.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,for you to rise up early,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:11.87,0:20:13.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,to sit up late,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:13.08,0:20:15.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,to eat the bread of sorrows:
Dialogue: 4,0:20:15.51,0:20:18.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,for so he giveth his beloved sleep.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:19.96,0:20:22.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,This psalm speaks into the work
Dialogue: 4,0:20:22.13,0:20:23.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,of building a life.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:23.64,0:20:26.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may know the feeling of adding
Dialogue: 4,0:20:26.18,0:20:28.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,another hour because you are afraid
Dialogue: 4,0:20:28.79,0:20:31.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,everything depends on your effort.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:31.50,0:20:32.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can hear its
Dialogue: 4,0:20:32.84,0:20:35.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,invitation to dependence.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:35.12,0:20:36.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your work matters,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:36.46,0:20:38.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you can also reach
Dialogue: 4,0:20:38.11,0:20:39.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,a stopping place.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:39.56,0:20:40.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are a person
Dialogue: 4,0:20:40.83,0:20:42.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,who needs replenishment.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:42.92,0:20:45.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can let that need belong
Dialogue: 4,0:20:45.01,0:20:47.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,within your relationship with God,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:47.55,0:20:49.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,without making exhaustion
Dialogue: 4,0:20:49.42,0:20:51.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,the measure of your devotion.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:53.26,0:20:53.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:53.57,0:20:55.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,I leave the extra hour
Dialogue: 4,0:20:55.29,0:20:57.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,of effort I was trying
Dialogue: 4,0:20:57.00,0:20:59.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,to borrow from this night.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:59.20,0:21:00.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,If my duties require
Dialogue: 4,0:21:00.82,0:21:02.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,me to be awake,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:02.04,0:21:04.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me practical support
Dialogue: 4,0:21:04.07,0:21:05.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,and a chance to
Dialogue: 4,0:21:05.29,0:21:06.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,rest when I can.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:06.76,0:21:08.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,If I am free to stop,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:08.43,0:21:10.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me accept that freedom.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:10.82,0:21:12.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for enough humility
Dialogue: 4,0:21:12.82,0:21:15.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,to live as a person with limits.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:15.55,0:21:17.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive the work I completed
Dialogue: 4,0:21:17.48,0:21:19.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the work that must wait
Dialogue: 4,0:21:19.35,0:21:21.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,for another part of the day.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:22.97,0:21:25.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can let the last sentence
Dialogue: 4,0:21:25.20,0:21:27.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,fade without replacing it.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:27.37,0:21:29.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Notice the support beneath
Dialogue: 4,0:21:29.40,0:21:30.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,your head or back.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:30.99,0:21:34.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,There is no special rhythm to achieve.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:34.00,0:21:35.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may be quiet
Dialogue: 4,0:21:35.22,0:21:36.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,for a little while,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:36.67,0:21:38.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,with nothing to explain
Dialogue: 4,0:21:38.43,0:21:40.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,and no new concern to name.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:43.67,0:21:45.47,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Peace I leave with you,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:45.47,0:21:47.60,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}my peace I give unto you:
Dialogue: 5,0:21:47.60,0:21:49.65,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}not as the world giveth,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:49.65,0:21:51.20,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}give I unto you.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:51.20,0:21:53.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let not your heart be troubled,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:53.56,0:21:55.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,neither let it be afraid.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:57.14,0:21:59.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jesus speaks these words
Dialogue: 4,0:21:59.12,0:22:01.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,to his disciples as they face a
Dialogue: 4,0:22:01.68,0:22:03.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,difficult parting.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:03.34,0:22:04.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can hear the care
Dialogue: 4,0:22:04.80,0:22:06.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,in what he leaves with them.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:06.93,0:22:09.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,His peace is offered amid a story
Dialogue: 4,0:22:09.40,0:22:11.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,that still contains sorrow
Dialogue: 4,0:22:11.35,0:22:12.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,and uncertainty.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:12.72,0:22:15.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can bring your own unfinished
Dialogue: 4,0:22:15.26,0:22:17.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,story near these words.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:17.21,0:22:18.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need to know
Dialogue: 4,0:22:18.94,0:22:20.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,its next chapter.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:20.40,0:22:23.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can receive Christ’s invitation
Dialogue: 4,0:22:23.00,0:22:25.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,as a gift addressed to people
Dialogue: 4,0:22:25.16,0:22:27.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,who need his company and courage.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:29.29,0:22:29.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jesus,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:29.72,0:22:31.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me receive what you give
Dialogue: 4,0:22:31.80,0:22:33.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,with a willing heart.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:33.48,0:22:35.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have searched for peace
Dialogue: 4,0:22:35.46,0:22:37.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,in a completed list,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:37.05,0:22:38.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,an encouraging reply,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:38.71,0:22:41.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,or knowing exactly what will happen.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:41.75,0:22:43.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Those things cannot carry
Dialogue: 4,0:22:43.66,0:22:45.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,everything I ask of them.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:45.75,0:22:48.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,I turn toward you now.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:48.00,0:22:50.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Stay with me in the uncertainty
Dialogue: 4,0:22:50.24,0:22:51.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,that remains,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:51.18,0:22:53.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,and teach me to recognize
Dialogue: 4,0:22:53.00,0:22:55.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,your kindness through Scripture,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:55.32,0:22:56.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,through prayer,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:56.40,0:22:58.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,and through the people who offer
Dialogue: 4,0:22:58.72,0:23:00.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,steady care in my life.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:02.07,0:23:04.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can leave the unanswered
Dialogue: 4,0:23:04.30,0:23:06.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,message where it is.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:06.07,0:23:07.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have brought
Dialogue: 4,0:23:07.17,0:23:08.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,the waiting into prayer,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:08.81,0:23:10.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you do not need
Dialogue: 4,0:23:10.12,0:23:12.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,to refresh the story now.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:12.01,0:23:13.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,Somewhere beyond this room,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:13.99,0:23:16.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,another person has their own
Dialogue: 4,0:23:16.05,0:23:18.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,evening and their own limits.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:18.36,0:23:20.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can let them have that space.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:20.94,0:23:23.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can let yourself have this one.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:23.68,0:23:24.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,For the moment,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:24.80,0:23:26.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,your attention may rest
Dialogue: 4,0:23:26.52,0:23:28.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,with words already given,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:28.39,0:23:30.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,instead of words you are still
Dialogue: 4,0:23:30.63,0:23:32.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,waiting to receive.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:33.73,0:23:35.44,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD shall preserve
Dialogue: 5,0:23:35.44,0:23:37.04,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thee from all evil:
Dialogue: 5,0:23:37.04,0:23:39.80,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he shall preserve thy soul.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:41.14,0:23:43.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,The pilgrim’s song gives you language
Dialogue: 4,0:23:43.80,0:23:46.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,for trusting the Lord as keeper.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:46.28,0:23:49.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can hear its strong confidence
Dialogue: 4,0:23:49.03,0:23:51.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,without using it to predict
Dialogue: 4,0:23:51.22,0:23:53.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,the details of tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:53.34,0:23:55.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,The psalm turns your attention toward
Dialogue: 4,0:23:55.94,0:23:58.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,the One to whom your life matters.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:58.51,0:24:00.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can pray for protection
Dialogue: 4,0:24:00.58,0:24:02.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,and still make wise choices
Dialogue: 4,0:24:02.66,0:24:04.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the world you inhabit.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:04.77,0:24:06.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here in this quiet
Dialogue: 4,0:24:06.05,0:24:07.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,portion of the night,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:07.54,0:24:09.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can place your whole
Dialogue: 4,0:24:09.25,0:24:11.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,self within that prayer.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:12.63,0:24:14.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keeper of my life,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:14.10,0:24:15.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,I entrust the deepest
Dialogue: 4,0:24:15.80,0:24:18.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,parts of me to your care.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:18.02,0:24:20.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,Preserve what is tender from
Dialogue: 4,0:24:20.01,0:24:22.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,becoming hard through fear.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:22.10,0:24:24.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Protect my willingness to love,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:24.57,0:24:26.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,my desire to tell the truth,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:26.80,0:24:29.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my readiness to ask for guidance.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:29.92,0:24:32.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I need a wise boundary,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:32.28,0:24:34.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me recognize it.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:34.18,0:24:37.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I need a trustworthy companion,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:37.08,0:24:38.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me welcome one.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:38.84,0:24:41.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,I rest my hope in you beyond
Dialogue: 4,0:24:41.09,0:24:42.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,the small circle
Dialogue: 4,0:24:42.38,0:24:44.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,of what I can oversee.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:45.83,0:24:47.76,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD shall preserve thy
Dialogue: 5,0:24:47.76,0:24:49.47,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}going out and thy coming
Dialogue: 5,0:24:49.47,0:24:51.19,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in from this time forth,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:51.19,0:24:53.11,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and even for evermore.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:54.44,0:24:56.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have crossed doorways today,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:56.76,0:24:59.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,entering places with things to do
Dialogue: 4,0:24:59.16,0:25:02.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,and leaving them with things unfinished.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:02.24,0:25:04.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,The psalm includes coming
Dialogue: 4,0:25:04.08,0:25:06.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,and going in its language of care.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:06.77,0:25:09.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can let that breadth comfort you.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:09.57,0:25:11.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your life is more than the last
Dialogue: 4,0:25:11.96,0:25:14.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,difficult moment before bed.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:14.30,0:25:15.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are known across
Dialogue: 4,0:25:15.72,0:25:18.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,the ordinary movements of a day,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:18.00,0:25:20.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you can entrust the movements
Dialogue: 4,0:25:20.35,0:25:22.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,still ahead without walking through
Dialogue: 4,0:25:22.85,0:25:25.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,them in your imagination tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:26.88,0:25:27.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:27.26,0:25:29.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,receive the journeys of this day,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:29.78,0:25:31.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,the familiar roads
Dialogue: 4,0:25:31.15,0:25:33.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the unexpected turns.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:33.24,0:25:35.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,I thank you for places where
Dialogue: 4,0:25:35.24,0:25:37.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,I was welcomed and people
Dialogue: 4,0:25:37.03,0:25:38.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,whose presence helped me.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:38.99,0:25:41.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the places that felt
Dialogue: 4,0:25:41.19,0:25:42.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,difficult as well.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:42.78,0:25:44.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,As I remain here now,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:44.40,0:25:46.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,I release the need to visit
Dialogue: 4,0:25:46.49,0:25:48.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,them all again in thought.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:48.68,0:25:50.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,When it is time to go
Dialogue: 4,0:25:50.38,0:25:52.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,out or come in tomorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:52.32,0:25:54.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,guide my choices with wisdom
Dialogue: 4,0:25:54.60,0:25:56.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my words with care.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:58.14,0:26:00.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may find that you have
Dialogue: 4,0:26:00.22,0:26:01.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,fewer words now,
Dialogue: 4,0:26:01.49,0:26:02.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,or you may notice
Dialogue: 4,0:26:02.85,0:26:05.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,that your mind remains active.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:05.42,0:26:06.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Either way,
Dialogue: 4,0:26:06.24,0:26:09.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can let the prayer become simpler.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:09.21,0:26:12.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have already said much that matters.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:12.06,0:26:14.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need to repeat every
Dialogue: 4,0:26:14.56,0:26:16.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,concern to keep it within
Dialogue: 4,0:26:16.57,0:26:18.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,God’s attention.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:18.04,0:26:20.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can rest beside a single
Dialogue: 4,0:26:20.13,0:26:22.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,truth from these readings,
Dialogue: 4,0:26:22.06,0:26:24.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,allowing the rest of the conversation
Dialogue: 4,0:26:24.82,0:26:27.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,to become quiet without bringing
Dialogue: 4,0:26:27.21,0:26:29.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,it to a perfect conclusion.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:30.90,0:26:31.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:26:31.44,0:26:33.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the urge to keep
Dialogue: 4,0:26:33.31,0:26:34.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,counting the hours.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:34.96,0:26:36.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I turn the clock
Dialogue: 4,0:26:36.90,0:26:39.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,into another source of pressure,
Dialogue: 4,0:26:39.29,0:26:41.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,measuring how well I am resting.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:41.86,0:26:44.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me step away from that judgment.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:44.73,0:26:47.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me patience for the present moment,
Dialogue: 4,0:26:47.60,0:26:50.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,whether it is quiet or restless.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:50.07,0:26:51.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for the rest I need
Dialogue: 4,0:26:51.97,0:26:54.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,without bargaining with the night.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:54.73,0:26:57.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive my wish for an easier morning,
Dialogue: 4,0:26:57.53,0:27:00.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,and help me meet whatever morning brings
Dialogue: 4,0:27:00.47,0:27:03.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,with appropriate support and care.
Dialogue: 5,0:27:04.65,0:27:05.60,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Come unto me,
Dialogue: 5,0:27:05.60,0:27:06.91,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}all ye that labour
Dialogue: 5,0:27:06.91,0:27:08.37,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and are heavy laden,
Dialogue: 5,0:27:08.37,0:27:10.54,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and I will give you rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:11.87,0:27:14.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,The invitation begins with coming.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:14.87,0:27:16.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can come with the weight
Dialogue: 4,0:27:16.98,0:27:18.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,you actually carry,
Dialogue: 4,0:27:18.42,0:27:20.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,even if you cannot explain
Dialogue: 4,0:27:20.38,0:27:22.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,why it feels so heavy.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:22.22,0:27:24.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can come after a productive
Dialogue: 4,0:27:24.54,0:27:26.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,day or a day that seemed
Dialogue: 4,0:27:26.34,0:27:28.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,to get away from you.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:28.09,0:27:29.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can come with faith
Dialogue: 4,0:27:29.75,0:27:31.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,that feels small.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:31.15,0:27:33.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need to sort yourself
Dialogue: 4,0:27:33.56,0:27:36.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,into a more acceptable condition first.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:36.67,0:27:39.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the welcome of Jesus have room
Dialogue: 4,0:27:39.19,0:27:42.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the place where you are resting.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:43.47,0:27:43.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jesus,
Dialogue: 4,0:27:43.95,0:27:46.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,I answer your welcome with the small
Dialogue: 4,0:27:46.84,0:27:49.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,amount of attention I have left.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:49.60,0:27:51.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the weight of trying
Dialogue: 4,0:27:51.65,0:27:54.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,to be ready for every possibility.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:54.32,0:27:56.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me a life that receives
Dialogue: 4,0:27:56.63,0:27:59.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,help and makes room for rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:59.11,0:28:01.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,I leave the next step in its
Dialogue: 4,0:28:01.28,0:28:03.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,appointed place tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:28:03.39,0:28:05.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,For these remaining moments,
Dialogue: 4,0:28:05.53,0:28:08.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,let my prayer be uncomplicated:
Dialogue: 4,0:28:08.09,0:28:09.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am here before you,
Dialogue: 4,0:28:09.74,0:28:11.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,with my weariness,
Dialogue: 4,0:28:11.16,0:28:13.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,trusting your invitation enough
Dialogue: 4,0:28:13.59,0:28:16.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,to stop preparing another explanation.
Dialogue: 4,0:28:18.26,0:28:19.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can leave tonight
Dialogue: 4,0:28:19.94,0:28:21.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,unfinished in small,
Dialogue: 4,0:28:21.54,0:28:22.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,ordinary ways.
Dialogue: 4,0:28:22.84,0:28:25.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,The note can stay folded.
Dialogue: 4,0:28:25.15,0:28:26.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,The message can remain
Dialogue: 4,0:28:26.78,0:28:28.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,where you left it.
Dialogue: 4,0:28:28.29,0:28:29.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,The question can wait
Dialogue: 4,0:28:29.76,0:28:32.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the person who can answer it.
Dialogue: 4,0:28:32.25,0:28:33.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have not forgotten
Dialogue: 4,0:28:33.86,0:28:35.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,your responsibilities;
Dialogue: 4,0:28:35.65,0:28:37.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,you have given one of them
Dialogue: 4,0:28:37.48,0:28:38.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,a practical place.
Dialogue: 4,0:28:38.92,0:28:40.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now you can allow the night
Dialogue: 4,0:28:40.97,0:28:42.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,to contain something
Dialogue: 4,0:28:42.48,0:28:44.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,besides preparation.
Dialogue: 4,0:28:44.18,0:28:46.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can listen, be still,
Dialogue: 4,0:28:46.02,0:28:48.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,and receive these moments without
Dialogue: 4,0:28:48.44,0:28:51.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,turning them into another assignment.
Dialogue: 4,0:28:52.84,0:28:53.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:28:53.36,0:28:55.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place this evening before
Dialogue: 4,0:28:55.38,0:28:57.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,you just as it has been.
Dialogue: 4,0:28:57.35,0:28:59.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thank you for hearing each
Dialogue: 4,0:28:59.29,0:29:01.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,concern separately and receiving
Dialogue: 4,0:29:01.68,0:29:04.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,the words I struggled to find.
Dialogue: 4,0:29:04.10,0:29:06.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me carry the practical commitment
Dialogue: 4,0:29:06.82,0:29:09.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,into tomorrow when its time comes.
Dialogue: 4,0:29:09.44,0:29:10.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Until then,
Dialogue: 4,0:29:10.41,0:29:13.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for a gentle heart toward
Dialogue: 4,0:29:13.14,0:29:15.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,myself and those around me.
Dialogue: 4,0:29:15.70,0:29:18.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your care remain the thought
Dialogue: 4,0:29:18.24,0:29:20.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,beside my unanswered questions.
Dialogue: 4,0:29:20.87,0:29:23.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,I leave the conversation here for now,
Dialogue: 4,0:29:23.70,0:29:26.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,held within your enduring love.
